  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Four speakers will address the meeting in $4 !$ ways $=24$ different ways in which half number of cases will be such that $P$ speaks before $Q$ and half number of case will be such that $P$ speaks after $Q$\r\n$\\therefore$ Required number of ways $=\\frac{24}{2}=12$",
